# `FROM` in capitals at the head of a `let` value (DS0105).
mode: syntax
---- query
let t = FROM orders | where a > 1;
from t
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..42
  LET_STMT@0..33
    LET_KW@0..3 "let"
    WHITESPACE@3..4 " "
